```console
$ scherzo-cloud publication create --help
Create a publication

Usage: scherzo-cloud publication create [OPTIONS] --export <NAME> <ORGANIZATION> <RUN>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUN>           Run ID

Options:
      --export <NAME>                  Git branch export name (must be available)
      --idempotency-key <KEY>          Opaque request identity (generated when omitted)
      --wait                           Wait for a terminal publication
      --timeout <DURATION>             Stop waiting after a positive duration (units: ms, s, m, or h)
      --json                           Print the publication result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
